{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21577","headline":"放言五首 三 · 元稹","name":"放言五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霆轰电烻数声频，不奈狂夫不藉身。\n纵使被雷烧作烬，宁殊埋骨扬爲尘。\n得成蝴蝶寻花树，傥化江鱼掉锦鳞。\n必若乖龙在诸处，何须惊动自来人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}